                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty much more of the same game as the first and that's a good thing. Turn based tactical fights that punish every bad move and making choices that can get people killed [i]permanently[/i]. Your XP and your shopping money are the same so every upgrade feels like a [strike]tough[/strike] painful decision. The handdrawn art and soundtrack are still gorgeous. If you liked the first one, you'll like this.\n\n[spoiler]Losing characters you've dragged through two games still hurts every time.[/spoiler]",
